body:
Some of the annotations of Tenascin complex disappeared as compared to when I placed this ticket [#31064](https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/31064), might be due to the basement membrane request [#6002](https://github.com/geneontology/go-annotation/issues/6002).

Adding the following gene products to the annotation of Tenascin complex (GO:0090733):

- [x] TNC: Hs: [P24821](https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/P24821/entry); Mm: Tnc already annotated;
- [x] TNR: [Q92752](https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/Q92752/entry); Mm: Tnr already annotated;
- [x] TNXB: P22105(https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/P22105/entry); Mm: [O35452](https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/O35452/entry), no reviewed record
